Package: rbioanp
Title: Access and Analyze Biodiversity Data from Peru's Protected Natural Areas
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", ,
    "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Provides comprehensive access to curated biodiversity datasets from
    Peru's National System of State-Protected Natural Areas (SINANPE) through the
    bioANP platform. The package includes standardized datasets of flora and fauna
    species inventories, occurrence records, and official protected area information.
    Facilitates biodiversity research and conservation analysis with cleaned taxonomic
    data and occurrence records from 55,000+ documented species across Peru's diverse
    ecosystems.
